sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Worker JobService
    participant D as Postgres
    participant U as AuditChain
    participant R as OutboxRelay
    participant P as Publisher
    participant K as IdempotentConsumer
    loop every 1s reconciler
        W->>D: BEGIN plus SET LOCAL app tenant
        W->>D: deaden QUEUED attempts exhausted
        W->>D: deaden RUNNING expired attempts exhausted
        W->>D: release RUNNING expired to QUEUED
        W->>U: append commit DEAD per dead id only
        U->>D: INSERT audit_events commit DEAD
        D-->>W: COMMIT released plus dead counts
    end
    W->>D: heartbeat owner token live lease only
    D-->>W: true or false no audit
    loop poll relay
        R->>D: poll outbox sent IS NULL LIMIT 100 SKIP LOCKED
        D-->>R: batch OutboxEvent with event_id
        R->>P: publish event with event_id header
        alt publish throws
            R->>D: skip mark republish later
        else publish ok
            R->>D: UPDATE outbox SET sent_at in new txn
            P->>K: consume event_id
            K->>D: INSERT processed_events ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
            alt first time
                D-->>K: true apply once
            else redelivery
                D-->>K: false skip duplicate
            end
        end
    end
